@baseUrl = http://localhost:5266

### Step 1 — Login to get token (run first)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": "tclaiborne",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

###

### Step 2 — Get holdings → expect 200 + list with computed fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 3 — Get trade log → expect 200 + list ordered newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trades
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 4 — Buy shares → expect 201 + TradeResponse with NewCashBalance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Step 5 — Verify holdings updated after buy → AAPL quantity increased
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 6 — Verify portfolio cash decreased after buy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 7 — Sell partial shares → expect 201 + TradeResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Step 8 — Sell ALL remaining shares → holding should be deleted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 6
}

###

### Step 9 — Buy unknown ticker → expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "FAKE",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Step 10 — Sell ticker you don't own → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/sell
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "MSFT",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Step 11 — Buy more than cash allows → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trades/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 999999
}

###

### Step 12 — Hit holdings without token → expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holdings

###

### Step 13 — Hit trades without token → expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trades